{"id":"4c3a40ac2277e7d0","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-peano-arithmetic.md","title":"Peano Arithmetic","display":"df-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-peano-arithmetic","aliases":["90-df-peano-arithmetic"],"display":"df-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-free-variable]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-peano-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-peano-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-peano-arithmetic — Peano Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5385f3fe07cb98ef\" href=\"?note=5385f3fe07cb98ef\" title=\"90-df-free-variable\">90-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，签名及代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5385f3fe07cb98ef\" href=\"?note=5385f3fe07cb98ef\" title=\"90-df-free-variable\">90-df-free-variable</a>，有序变量表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VList}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{VList}_S\\)</span> 和有限量词列见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>；理论加公理集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec z(x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\vec z(x,\\varphi)\\)</span> 为下式定义的参数变量列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndAx}_x\">\\(\\mathrm{IndAx}_x\\)</span> 在全部所列扩张签名上具有同一接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}\">\\(\\mathrm{IND}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q+\\mathrm{IND}\">\\(Q+\\mathrm{IND}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的呈示加句子公理集运算，不是把三元组与句子集合直接求并。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})\">\\(\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a> 的等号一阶 Hilbert 证明呈示，仍为公式集、公理集和规则模式组成的三元组；增加句子公理使用该文件的呈示加公理运算。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec z(x,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{VList}_S(\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IndAx}_x(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall\\vec z(x,\\varphi)\\ \\Bigl[\n(\\varphi[0/x]\\land\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[S(x)/x]))\\to\\forall x\\varphi\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{IND}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{IndAx}_x(\\varphi):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\},\\\\\nPA&amp;\\coloneqq Q+\\mathrm{IND}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec z(x,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{VList}_S(\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IndAx}_x(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall\\vec z(x,\\varphi)\\ \\Bigl[\n(\\varphi[0/x]\\land\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\varphi[S(x)/x]))\\to\\forall x\\varphi\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{IND}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{IndAx}_x(\\varphi):\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\},\\\\\nPA&amp;\\coloneqq Q+\\mathrm{IND}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PA\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}},\\qquad\nPA=\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})+(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\cup\\mathrm{IND}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PA\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}},\\qquad\nPA=\\mathrm{FOL}_{=}(S_{\\mathrm{arith}})+(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\cup\\mathrm{IND}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留允许参数的一阶归纳模式。参数顺序及参数集合不再依赖临时约定，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndAx}_x\">\\(\\mathrm{IndAx}_x\\)</span> 真正是由输入公式确定的函数。该公式映射也可在算术的扩张签名上使用，供 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PRA\">\\(PRA\\)</span> 调用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA\">\\(PA\\)</span> 自身仍只取原算术语言的全部公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Sigma_\\omega\">\\(I\\Sigma_\\omega\\)</span> 的别名和并集性质在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"c61fe71286984490\" href=\"?note=c61fe71286984490\" title=\"90-df-isigma-hierarchy\">90-df-isigma-hierarchy</a> 中给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b278